// expect: 2
// .beta IS 2. The banked 1 was the old wheel's silent-wrong: map's element
// instance never crossed the fn boundary (the dropped closed-tail row), the
// record layout never resolved, and the field read floored to offset 0 —
// alpha's slot. The element flows now; the read is the true field.
fn main(q) = last(map((x) => x, [{alpha: 1, beta: 2, gamma: 3}])).beta
